// held, and performs main.cpp's sequence -- settle, load the ELF, reset, run --
// inside one SC_THREAD, where advancing a cycle is wait() and not sc_start.
// Everything mechanism-specific about that lives in platform/cycle_clock.hpp;
// this file only decides which one applies (ScWaitClock, always: a module is
// never the kernel's owner).
//
